ance rules out years‑long war in Middle East amid possible US strike on Iran]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128858995.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/theres-no-chance-jd-vance-rules-out-yearslong-war-in-middle-east-amid-possible-us-strike-on-iran/articleshow/128858995.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/theres-no-chance-jd-vance-rules-out-yearslong-war-in-middle-east-amid-possible-us-strike-on-iran/articleshow/128858995.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-27T22:03:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128858995,imgsize-69588.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Somali truck driver pulled off road after driving wrong way in Missouri, fails English proficiency test]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128856549.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Somali truck driver, driving an 80-ton vehicle the wrong way on a Missouri highway, was taken out of service after failing an English proficiency test. Authorities confirmed the driver, licensed in Minnesota, could not read basic road signs. Investigations are underway into how he obtained his commercial driver's license.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/somali-truck-driver-pulled-off-road-after-driving-wrong-way-in-missouri-fails-english-proficiency-test/articleshow/128856549.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/somali-truck-driver-pulled-off-road-after-driving-wrong-way-in-missouri-fails-english-proficiency-test/articleshow/128856549.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-27T21:28:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator